# SMARTvisuals

Resume: `@smartvisuals$` / `$smartvisuals$`. Official spellings (never translate): **SMARTvisuals**, **SMARTstencils**, **SMARTbackgrounds**, **SMARTview**, **SMARTpreview**, **SMARTnotification**. Protected brands: FloqR, Mingl, ShoutOut, BOT DEE / BOT-DEE, floqCast, VIP reserV.

## What it is

A **shared visual service**, not a Features & Services Search tile. Layers on `mingl` + `botDee`. Scenic art is **original SVG illustration**, not photography and not an official destination/Fashion Week/Burning Man mark.

## Source of truth

| Surface | Truth |
|---|---|
| Published assets | git `smartvisuals/registry.json` + `catalog.json` + SVG files (26 stencils, 34 backgrounds) |
| Unpublished drafts | Firestore `smartVisualDrafts` (Master Admin read; Functions-write; sanitized `svgXml` + checksum so Review can preview) |
| Overrides / cache / ads / audit | `smartVisualOverrides`, `smartVisualSelections`, `smartVisualAdPolicy`, `smartVisualAuditLogs` |

Default-deny: unpublished / unlicensed / unsanitized assets never resolve for patrons.

## Resolver

`smartvisuals-resolver.js` (root ≡ `functions/`). Deterministic tags + aliases. **Gemini off** (`geminiAllowed() === false`) — do not call a model on card view. Private chat `sourceKind: private-chat` → no public SMARTnotification. Prompt injection / remote URLs → ignore + neutral `bg-mingl-room` + `st-people`. Collision (Seattle LA) → same neutral. Cancun Trip → travel + `st-flight` + `bg-bali` (kit has no cancun.svg).

## Surfaces

1. **Search SMARTnotification** — `index.html` `#smartvisualNotificationHost`. Demo only: `?smartvisualInvite=cancun`. View Invitation / Not Now. No fabricated live rooms for all patrons.
2. **Room SMARTview** — overlay + BOT DEE card hero from `authorizedTitle` / `authorizedDescription` on the request payload (current utterance; never private thread). `botdee.html` loads `smartvisuals/catalog.json` via `ensureCatalog()`.
3. **Master Admin SMARTvisual Studio** — `#smartvisualStudio`. SOS2FA + `FLOQRReasonPrompt` to submit drafts. Ads tab documents the empty labeled slot.

Join Now uses `FLOQRNav` (no `?v=`). Display URLs unchanged.

## Ads / headless

Labeled slot below the card. AdSense **never loaded** until a separate policy review. Visual classification must **not** invoke headless partner tools.

